  "comment": "Pinned vendored dependencies for RavenEngine. Versions are recorded from the vendored sources at the time of vendoring; verify before bumping. Regenerate SBOM with scripts/generate_sbom.py. Two dependencies are too large to vendor and are instead pinned git submodules (third_party/slang, third_party/assimp) \u2014 fetch with `git submodule update --init`. Nsight Aftermath is a proprietary NVIDIA SDK and is NOT redistributed here; see docs/BUILDING.md. Vulkan itself is a system dependency (headers vendored under third_party/Vulkan-Headers).",
